# Dokkaebi (도깨비), the trickster goblin of Korean folklore: one horn,
# shaggy hair, a straw cape and a studded club. Side view, faces right.
# swing_0 raises the club, swing_1 slams it into the floor (shake, no hit).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 32 48
@output ../characters/creature_dokkaebi.png
